{"ref":"BDB, עָשִׁיר","hw":"עָשִׁיר","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָשִׁיר</span></big><sub>23</sub>  <strong>adj.</strong> et <strong>n. rich</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:15\" href=\"/Exodus.30.15\">Ex 30:15</a> + 19 times; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׁירִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.6\">Ec 10:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׁירֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:13\" href=\"/Psalms.45.13\">ψ 45:13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׁירֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:12\" href=\"/Micah.6.12\">Mi 6:12</a>;—<strong>adj.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.1\">2 S 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.4\">4</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָאשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:10\" href=\"/Ruth.3.10\">Ru 3:10</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span>); usually <strong>n.m.</strong> <em>the rich</em>, opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.15\">Pr 10:15</a> + 3 times; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.2\">2 S 12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.20\">Pr 14:20</a> + 4 times; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְיוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:3\" href=\"/Psalms.49.3\">ψ 49:3</a>; alone <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.22\">Je 9:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:12\" href=\"/Micah.6.12\">Mi 6:12</a> + 5 times, + <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשִׁירֵי עָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:13\" href=\"/Psalms.45.13\">ψ 45:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.9\">Is 53:9</a> is prob. crpt., cf. ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשָׁעִים</span>; Bö Ry Di-Kit <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֵׂי רַע</span>; Krochm Gr Che<sup>Hpt</sup> conj. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשָׁעִים</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּשְׁעִים</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>.","next":"BDB, עָשֵׁשׁ","prev":"BDB, עֹ֫שֶׁר"}